  {
   "type": "heading",
   "attrs": {
    "level": 3
   },
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "Current and expected behaviour"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "bulletList",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "listItem",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "Current:",
         "marks": [
          {
           "type": "strong"
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": " the change is not saved, and the message does not say which field is the problem."
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "listItem",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "Expected",
         "marks": [
          {
           "type": "strong"
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": " (from this ticket): \"The system should successfully save the updated part when all required information is present. If a required parameter is missing or invalid, the error message should clearly identify the affected field so the user can correct it.\""
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "attrs": {
    "level": 3
   },
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "What makes it happen"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "bulletList",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "listItem",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "It happens only when the part was first added from the "
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "Catalog",
         "marks": [
          {
           "type": "strong"
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": " option and is then switched to the "
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "Inventory",
         "marks": [
          {
           "type": "strong"
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": " option of the "
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "same",
         "marks": [
          {
           "type": "strong"
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": " part number. That matches the customer's note that part #920183 \"appears in both Inventory and Catalog\"."
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "listItem",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "The "
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "Amount",
         "marks": [
          {
           "type": "strong"
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": " doesn't matter: 1, 25 and leaving it empty all give the same error."
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "listItem",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "If the part was first added under a "
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "different",
         "marks": [
          {
           "type": "strong"
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": " part number (a generic one) and then replaced with an Inventory part, it saves without an error. That may be why it could not be reproduced before."
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
