     "text": "Production app.shopview.com, build v26.40.17-f5bf8f4, 13 October 2026, location Trucks Hill 2, work order S2-968, part ZZ11243-920183, logged in with our production test account (bilal.muzamil@shopview.com). Reproduced 4 times; the last time was just before posting this comment."
